{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-2","name":"プロデューサー","text":"本物の雪じゃないけど","trans":"虽然不是真正的雪","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-3","name":"プロデューサー","text":"それだったら──\r\n降ってるところ、いつでも見られるなと思って","trans":"但这样的话──\n我想着就能随时看到下雪的样子了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017710020","name":"冬優子","text":"────……ふふ","trans":"────……呵呵","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017710030","name":"冬優子","text":"……風情がなーい","trans":"……一点情调都没有","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-6","name":"プロデューサー","text":"はは……\r\nそうだな、確かに","trans":"哈哈……\n是啊，确实","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017710050","name":"冬優子","text":"ありがと。嬉しい","trans":"谢谢。我很高兴","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}